  "subject": "情报学研究科_数理工学",
  "text": "设 $D=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb{R}^2\\mid 0\\le y\\le x\\}$。求广义积分 $\\displaystyle\\iint_D \\dfrac{1}{(x^2+y^2+1)^2}\\,dx\\,dy$ 的值。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "二重广义积分",
    "极坐标变换",
    "反常积分收敛性"
  ],
  "question_type": "二重广义积分计算",
  "method": [
    "转换为极坐标",
    "确定角度范围与半径范围",
    "分离变量分别积分"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "分析区域 $D$ 在极坐标下对应的角度范围",
    "写出极坐标下的积分表达式，代入 $x^2+y^2=r^2$，面积元 $r\\,dr\\,d\\theta$",
    "先对 $r$ 积分（广义积分到无穷），再对 $\\theta$ 积分"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "double_improper_integral_polar",
    "template": "\\iint_{0\\le y\\le x} \\dfrac{1}{(x^2+y^2+1)^2}dxdy",
    "variable_count": 2
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "积分值",
      "steps": [
        "区域 $D=\\{0\\le y\\le x\\}$ 在极坐标 $(r,\\theta)$（$x=r\\cos\\theta,y=r\\sin\\theta$）下对应 $r\\ge0$，$\\theta\\in[0,\\pi/4]$（因为 $y\\le x$ 且 $y\\ge0$ 恰好是第一象限内到 $45°$ 线以下的部分）",
        "积分变为 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\int_0^\\infty \\dfrac{r}{(r^2+1)^2}\\,dr\\,d\\theta$（面积元为 $r\\,dr\\,d\\theta$）",
        "计算内层积分：令 $u=r^2+1$，$du=2r\\,dr$，$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\infty \\dfrac{r}{(r^2+1)^2}dr=\\dfrac12\\int_1^\\infty \\dfrac{du}{u^2}=\\dfrac12\\left[-\\dfrac1u\\right]_1^\\infty=\\dfrac12(0-(-1))=\\dfrac12$",
        "外层对 $\\theta$ 积分：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/4} \\dfrac12\\,d\\theta=\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}=\\dfrac{\\pi}{8}$。故积分值为 $\\dfrac{\\pi}{8}$。验算：被积函数处处为正且随$r\\to\\infty$按$r^{-3}$衰减，积分收敛，结果为正数 $\\pi/8$，合理"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
    {
      "text": "计算 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\infty \\dfrac{r}{(r^2+1)^2}\\,dr$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "换元积分",
        "广义积分"
      ],
      "question_type": "一元广义积分计算",
      "method": [
        "换元$u=r^2+1$"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "换元",
        "求原函数",
        "代入极限计算"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "improper_integral_substitution",
        "template": "\\int_0^\\infty \\dfrac{r}{(r^2+1)^2}dr",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "令$u=r^2+1$，$du=2rdr$，积分变为$\\dfrac12\\int_1^\\infty u^{-2}du$",
            "$=\\dfrac12\\left[-u^{-1}\\right]_1^\\infty=\\dfrac12(0+1)=\\dfrac12$",
            "结果为$1/2$，收敛"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kyoto-2024-a19745fad7-q05-practice-01",
