        "计算径向积分",
        "乘以角度区间长度"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "double_improper_integral_quadrant",
        "template": "\\iint_{x\\ge0,y\\ge0}\\dfrac{1}{(x^2+y^2+1)^2}dxdy",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "第一象限对应 $\\theta\\in[0,\\pi/2]$，径向积分同前为$1/2$",
            "积分值$=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\dfrac12=\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}$",
            "验算：第一象限是原题区域$D$的两倍（$D$为其一半，按对称性$y\\le x$与$y\\ge x$各占一半），故$\\pi/4=2\\times\\pi/8$，与原题答案吻合"
          ]
        }
