        "写出极坐标表达式",
        "分析径向积分$\\int r/(r^2+1)dr$的收敛性",
        "得出发散结论"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "improper_integral_divergence_check",
        "template": "\\iint_{0\\le y\\le x}\\dfrac{1}{x^2+y^2+1}dxdy",
